<title>GERMANY: Wintershall BASF details 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Wintershall BASF details 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>KASSEL, Germany 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   286     vs 25</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     833     vs 306</p>
<p>    Group sales				  5,558   vs 4,572</p>
<p>    Group investments in fixed assets    422     vs 470</p>
<p>    Oil output (in millions of tonnes)   7,287   vs 6,086</p>
<p>Gas output</p>
<p>    (in millions of cubic metres)	  2.5     vs 2.1</p>
<p>Natural gas sales</p>
<p>    (in millions of kilowatt hrs)	  168,500 vs 147,100</p>
<p>    Parent sales				 3,615   vs 2,754</p>
<p>    Parent investments in fixed assets   164     vs 269</p>
<p>    Parent operating profit		  600     vs 196</p>
<p>    Parent net profit			  224     vs 50</p>
<p>    Parent pre-tax profit		    656     vs 231</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    1,552   vs 1,620</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German of German oil and gas group is Wintershall AG. It is a subsidiary of chemicals group BASF AG BASF.F. Group profit figures are issued net of minorities.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
